{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26824","headline":"咏云 · 姚合","name":"咏云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霭霭纷纷不可穷，戛笙歌处尽随龙。\n来依银汉一千里，归傍巫山十二峰。\n呈瑞每闻开丽色，避风仍见挂乔松。\n怜君翠染双蝉鬓，镜里朝朝近玉容。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}